Package: maxdiffr
Title: MaxDiff (Best-Worst Scaling) Analysis Pipeline
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Loren", "Collingwood", email = "loren.collingwood@gmail.com",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A complete pipeline for MaxDiff (Best-Worst Scaling) survey analysis.
    Includes IBD design generation, response validation, data preparation (standard
    and anchored), aggregate and individual-level analysis via empirical Bayes,
    anchored 100-point scaling, model-based anchoring (conditional logit and
    hierarchical Bayes via 'Stan'), TURF analysis with portfolio optimization, and
    publication-ready plots.
